==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|mātrīculātus}}, past participle of {{m|la|mātrīculāre|t=to register}}, from {{m|la|mātrīcula|t=public register}}, a diminutive of {{der|en|la|mātrīx|t=list}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[enroll]] as a [[member]] of a [[body]], especially of a [[college]] or [[university]]
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[be]] [[enroll]]ed as a member of a body, especially of a college or university.

